linhas.en:
#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.
You've accumulated a lot of fatigue;
any more will be dangerous!

Well, well. What fine eyes you have, mongrel;
dazzled by avarice. Has your true nature shown
itself? That of a bill collector in pursuit?

I'm overflowing with skilled individuals;
leaving them idle is a waste. That's why
they're doing just a bit of slave labor.

That torture chamber we all saw was this world's hell.
Everyone had their freedom stripped away;
their blood and their magic circuits stolen.
